export anchor WarmCharcoalStyle:
    number: 227
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Warm charcoal
    idea: A brownish charcoal room lit by one amber lamp, with cream text, serif headings, soft rounded cards with progress rings and a journal of the day, cosy but still serious.
    base: dark
    palette:
        charcoal: #1c1714, the page, the sidebar and the style sheet
        card: #272019, cards, fields and the journal
        ember: #322920, status chips and the top of the greeting card
        seam: #45392d, borders, dashed dividers and ring tracks
        cream: #f3e8d8, text and figures
        parchment: #c4b49e, labels, meta and times
        amber: #f0a94b, the primary button, progress rings, this week bars, journal icons and focus
        onAmber: #2a1903, text on the amber button
        amberGlow: #3d2e1b, the current nav item
        lastWeek: #97836b, last week bars
        ok: #a8d8a0, the sage On track chip
        risk: #f5d77a, the straw At risk chip
        bad: #ffa28c, the coral Behind chip and the overdue line
    type:
        Headings and figures in a serif stack, Iowan Old Style, Palatino
        Linotype, Palatino, Book Antiqua, Georgia. Body in system-ui, Segoe
        UI, Roboto. Base 15px at 1.55. The greeting is 34px serif at 500,
        figures 34px serif with old style numbers, section titles 21px serif
        at 500, project names 16px at 650, times 12px serif italic.
    layout:
        A 240px charcoal sidebar holds an amber flag icon and the name in
        serif, then six nav links with icons, Home on an amber glow tile
        with a 3px amber inner edge. The main column starts with a pill
        search on the left and an amber pill New project, a round bell and
        Mara Okafor on the right. A large rounded greeting card follows,
        shaded from ember to card, with the date, Good morning, Mara in
        serif and a coral line reading 4 tasks are overdue and need you
        first, and on its right the four figures in serif. Below sit two
        columns. The left holds Your projects as a grid of six rounded cards,
        each with name, category, a 56px amber progress ring with the
        percent inside, a status pill, then tasks and due date under a dashed
        seam, followed by a chart card titled Tasks finished, day by day.
        The right 340px column is Today's journal, a timeline with amber
        icons on a thin line and italic serif times. Below 1180px the
        journal moves under the projects. Below 760px the sidebar becomes a
        row of icons and the figures go two by two.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 18px card padding, 16px card gaps, 28 to 32px between areas and a 36px gutter.
    density: Comfortable. Six project cards with rings, the chart below and the journal at the side.
    corners: Soft. 18px greeting card, 14px cards, 10px nav items and fields, pill buttons and chips.
    borders: 1px #45392d around cards, dashed seams inside cards, a 3px amber inner edge on the current nav item.
    shadows: Warm and soft, 0 6px 18px black at 28 percent on cards and 0 10px 30px at 35 percent on the greeting card.
    icons:
        Rounded line icons at 1.8 stroke, 18px, amber in the journal. Status
        is a check circle, a triangle or a crossed square inside a pill with
        the word.
    focus: A 2px amber outline offset 3px.
    tone: Warm and personal, such as Your projects, Today's journal and 4 tasks are overdue and need you first.
